    "detailed_description": "Wallrun, slide, bunnyhop, and strafe your way to the end of the level, replaying and shaving off precious seconds to get the fastest possible time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526150/extras/7e28057c654eda0a94c4a9baccc71169.poster.avif?t=1752661826\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526150/extras/7e28057c654eda0a94c4a9baccc71169.webm?t=1752661826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526150/extras/7e28057c654eda0a94c4a9baccc71169.mp4?t=1752661826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At its core, Cyber Sprint is all about speedrunning mastery. Players must become adept at navigating the digital landscapes with unparalleled agility, employing a combination of sprinting, sliding, jumping, and wall-running to maintain momentum and shave off precious seconds. Each level presents a unique set of challenges and puzzles that demand split-second decision-making and quick reflexes to outwit the game's obstacles and achieve the fastest possible times.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526150/extras/83c08529d7fb7da529782aae7c0b47f1.poster.avif?t=1752661826\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526150/extras/83c08529d7fb7da529782aae7c0b47f1.webm?t=1752661826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526150/extras/83c08529d7fb7da529782aae7c0b47f1.mp4?t=1752661826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in a high-octane gameplay experience, meticulously crafted to revolve entirely around a lightning-fast pace game and level design. Push your limits as you challenge yourself by making split-second decisions and overcoming the numerous obstacles that will do anything they can to slow you down.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526150/extras/03d24680ee8f2a97081a4de504af4731.poster.avif?t=1752661826\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526150/extras/03d24680ee8f2a97081a4de504af4731.webm?t=1752661826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526150/extras/03d24680ee8f2a97081a4de504af4731.mp4?t=1752661826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Time is your relentless adversary. Each level presents a ticking clock, compelling you to finish it as swiftly as possible. With competitions planned in the future, learning how to beat the levels and the entirety of the game is a huge part of the Cyber Sprint game loop.",
